WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.714
Heat pumps are the future of residential HVAC. R-410A replacements are all heat
pump compatible.

00:00:25.714 --> 00:00:51.429
System commissioning verifies everything works correctly after installation.
Checklist: verify refrigerant charge using superheat or subcooling method.
Measure total external static pressure (must be under 0.50 in w.c.). Measure

00:00:51.429 --> 00:01:17.143
Here are the key terms. Write these down.

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:42.857
Commissioning: Systematic verification that all system components are installed
and operating correctly.

00:01:42.857 --> 00:02:08.571
Here's why this matters on the job: Proper commissioning prevents callbacks. A
system that is not commissioned properly will have problems within the first
season.

00:02:08.571 --> 00:02:34.286
Watch out for these: Check TESP, temperature split, amp draw, and charge. And —
Test ALL modes: cooling, heating, fan only

00:02:34.286 --> 00:03:00.000
Take a minute before you move on. What's the one thing from this lesson you need
to remember on a service call?

